WEBVTT

1
00:02:22.694 --> 00:02:23.764
Nas troje?

2
00:02:23.902 --> 00:02:25.283
Zaplješćimo
Richu.

3
00:02:25.421 --> 00:02:27.771
To nikad ne dosadi.
Meni govori, ne tebi.

4
00:02:27.871 --> 00:02:29.597
Divan glas,
kapetane.

5
00:02:29.735 --> 00:02:32.152
Baš dobro.

6
00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:33.222
Užasna si.

7
00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:35.396
Znaš u čemu sam užasan?

8
00:02:35.534 --> 00:02:36.708
U braku.

9
00:02:36.846 --> 00:02:38.437
Prilično sam dobar
na prvim spojevima.

10
00:03:07.221 --> 00:03:08.498
Hej, dušo.

11
00:03:08.636 --> 00:03:11.229
Hvala Bogu. Mislila
sam da smo te propustili.

12
00:03:11.329 --> 00:03:12.747
Dobila sam tvoju poruku.

13
00:03:12.847 --> 00:03:15.543
Da, promijenili su raspored posade.

14
00:03:15.643 --> 00:03:16.748
Kad se vraćaš?

15
00:03:18.819 --> 00:03:20.824
Dušo, poslat ću ti
novi raspored čim ga dobijem.

16
00:03:20.924 --> 00:03:23.237
Bene,
znam da te boli.

17
00:03:23.375 --> 00:03:24.894
Oboje nas boli.

18
00:03:25.032 --> 00:03:27.521
Ali ne možeš stalno
bježati od toga.

19
00:03:27.621 --> 00:03:28.553
Pričekaj, dušo.

20
00:03:29.968 --> 00:03:31.935
Hej, Lisa,
našla si mi nešto.

21
00:03:32.073 --> 00:03:34.804
Ima ruta LA-Šangaj,
ali ne znam, uskoro polijeće.

22
00:03:34.904 --> 00:03:36.043
U redu, uzimam je.

23
00:03:36.181 --> 00:03:37.186
Nećeš imati vremena
otići kući.

24
00:03:37.286 --> 00:03:38.908
Nema veze. Uzimam je.

25
00:03:39.046 --> 00:03:40.706
Hej, Nadine mi je
na drugoj liniji.

26
00:03:40.806 --> 00:03:43.211
Nazvat ću te, može?

27
00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:48.918
Dušo?

28
00:03:49.056 --> 00:03:50.060
Mama, gdje si?
Naš sin je bolestan, Bene.

29
00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.714
Treba te ovdje.

30
00:03:51.852 --> 00:03:53.233
Moram ići.
Mama!

31
00:03:53.371 --> 00:03:54.786
Nadine...
Sean zove.

32
00:04:15.013 --> 00:04:17.291
Au.
Gospodine? Ovdje ne smijete pušiti.

33
00:04:18.188 --> 00:04:19.400
Kina, avioni, barovi.

34
00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:22.541
Sad više ne mogu ni vani pušiti
a da me ne gnjavi policija za zabavu.

35
00:04:22.641 --> 00:04:24.056
Ma dajte.
Gospodine.

36
00:04:24.194 --> 00:04:27.531
Označene zone za pušenje
nalaze se ondje.

37
00:04:44.732 --> 00:04:46.147
Jebote!

38
00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:54.604
Hej, Rich.

39
00:04:56.434 --> 00:04:57.990
Izgleda da sam ti kopilot za Šangaj.

40
00:04:58.090 --> 00:04:59.129
Dugo se nismo vidjeli.

41
00:04:59.229 --> 00:05:00.303
Čuo sam da odlaziš u mirovinu.

42
00:05:00.403 --> 00:05:01.270
Hvala.
Izvoli.

43
00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:02.302
Penny...
Hej.

44
00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:04.373
...propustila si karaoke večer.

45
00:05:04.511 --> 00:05:06.240
Čujem da si opet pjevao
istu pjesmu.

46
00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:08.687
Kvragu. Je li upalilo?

47
00:05:08.825 --> 00:05:10.724
Uvijek upali.

48
00:05:10.862 --> 00:05:12.691
Hvala.

49
00:05:12.829 --> 00:05:15.007
Oprostite, gospodine,
molim vas, ovuda.

50
00:05:15.107 --> 00:05:16.695
Dovraga.

51
00:05:16.833 --> 00:05:20.392
Izvukli su me za slučajnu provjeru.
Vidimo se na izlazu.

52
00:05:20.492 --> 00:05:21.531
Samo naprijed. Samo naprijed.

53
00:05:21.631 --> 00:05:22.632
Kako si, Penny?

54
00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:23.740
Dobro. Kako si ti?

55
00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:28.469
Vjerujete mi da upravljam avionom,
a brinete se zbog moje paste za zube.

56
00:05:28.569 --> 00:05:30.782
Imate li baterije ili power bankove?

57
00:05:30.882 --> 00:05:32.370
Gospodine?

58
00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:34.506
Uh, ne.

59
00:05:34.644 --> 00:05:39.085
Sigurno ne mogu dobiti bolju klasu?
Zlatni sam član, znate.

60
00:05:44.689 --> 00:05:46.276
Ne želim.

61
00:05:46.415 --> 00:05:48.140
Znaš kakva sam
kad letim.

62
00:05:48.278 --> 00:05:50.042
Dobro, slušaj,
moramo li to ovdje?

63
00:05:50.142 --> 00:05:51.078
Ne želim.
Baš ovdje? Znaš što.

64
00:05:51.178 --> 00:05:52.144
Ne kužiš.

65
00:05:52.282 --> 00:05:54.768
Avion za Šangaj veći je...
Ne, nisu.

66
00:05:54.906 --> 00:05:56.117
...od onih kojima si
dosad letjela. Dobro?

67
00:05:56.217 --> 00:05:58.119
To je nešto, zar ne?
Jeste li dobro?

68
00:05:58.219 --> 00:06:01.015
Da, u redu je. Moja kći
ne voli letjeti.

69
00:06:01.153 --> 00:06:03.363
Znaš što je opasnije
od leta avionom?

70
00:06:05.434 --> 00:06:07.405
Nilski konji.

71
00:06:07.505 --> 00:06:09.645
Nema šanse. To ste izmislili.

72
00:06:09.783 --> 00:06:11.754
Guglaj.

73
00:06:11.854 --> 00:06:13.269
Bit ćeš dobro.

74
00:06:13.407 --> 00:06:16.068
Osim ako netko ne prošverca
nilskog konja u avion.

75
00:06:16.168 --> 00:06:18.780
Jeste vi, kao, kapetan?

76
00:06:19.965 --> 00:06:21.691
Ne, ja sam prvi časnik.

77
00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:26.178
Moj je posao paziti da
kapetan leti ravno.

78
00:06:26.316 --> 00:06:28.011
Niste li prestari
da ne budete kapetan?

79
00:06:28.111 --> 00:06:29.527
Cora!

80
00:06:29.665 --> 00:06:31.149
Oštra, ha?
Da.

81
00:06:31.287 --> 00:06:32.875
Pa, Cora...

82
00:06:34.152 --> 00:06:35.429
ponekad u životu...

83
00:06:37.397 --> 00:06:41.055
moraš napraviti par zaobilazaka
da dođeš kamo ideš.

84
00:06:41.193 --> 00:06:42.543
Jesi li ikad morala zaobilaznim putem?

85
00:06:42.643 --> 00:06:44.611
Ne, izrazito sam točna.

86
00:06:46.164 --> 00:06:47.441
Dobra cura.

87
00:06:48.304 --> 00:06:49.892
Oštra je.

88
00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:51.341
Znam, hvala.
Cora.

89
00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:53.658
Cora, Cora, Cora, gledaj.
Vidi što mi je mama kupila.

90
00:06:53.758 --> 00:06:55.760
Hej, ekipa.
Gledaj, gledaj.

91
00:06:55.898 --> 00:06:57.420
Može li ta stvar
biti još glasnija?

92
00:06:57.520 --> 00:06:58.594
Znam. Kul, zar ne?

93
00:06:58.694 --> 00:07:01.720
I dobio sam
novu bateriju za ovo.

94
00:07:02.594 --> 00:07:03.871
Dobro, evo ga.

95
00:07:04.009 --> 00:07:06.655
Samo mu stavi čip za ljubimce u vrat.

96
00:07:06.943 --> 00:07:09.313
Uh...
Cora, možeš li?

97
00:07:09.705 --> 00:07:11.192
Nešto sam radila.
Vratit ću ti.

98
00:07:11.292 --> 00:07:12.604
Samo malo.

99
00:07:12.742 --> 00:07:14.882
Lozinka mu je rođendan.

100
00:07:18.196 --> 00:07:19.684
Slušaj, Cora, dušo,
trebat će nam da

101
00:07:19.784 --> 00:07:21.651
pripaziš na brata
na ovom putu, dobro?

102
00:07:21.751 --> 00:07:23.443
Polubrata.

103
00:07:30.035 --> 00:07:31.865
To je to.
To je zadnje od ovoga.

104
00:07:35.247 --> 00:07:37.376
Utovarite.

105
00:07:41.115 --> 00:07:42.220
Hvala.

106
00:07:42.358 --> 00:07:45.326
Northeastern Airlines,
let N-140 za Šangaj

107
00:07:45.465 --> 00:07:48.053
sada počinje ukrcaj.
Hej, hej!

108
00:07:48.191 --> 00:07:49.886
Da se nisi usudio
povratiti po meni, buraz.

109
00:07:49.986 --> 00:07:51.578
Ostavit ću tvoju
pijanu guzicu ovdje.

110
00:07:51.678 --> 00:07:52.886
Ne zezam se, Hutch.

111
00:07:56.441 --> 00:07:57.856
O, Bože, e-sport.

112
00:07:57.994 --> 00:08:00.238
Igranje videoigara
nije pravi sport.

113
00:08:00.376 --> 00:08:02.620
To je hrpa luzera
u maminom podrumu

114
00:08:02.758 --> 00:08:05.830
s vrećicama Doritosa i...
O, oprosti. Ispričavam se.

115
00:08:05.968 --> 00:08:07.348
Opa. Što ima, e-sport?

116
00:08:07.487 --> 00:08:09.592
Pusti.
Makni ruke s nje!

117
00:08:09.730 --> 00:08:11.908
Hej. Dobro. Oprosti.
Samo je malo pijan.

118
00:08:12.008 --> 00:08:14.597
Opa! Vatrena je. Sviđa mi se.

119
00:08:14.735 --> 00:08:16.668
Ne diraj je.

120
00:08:16.806 --> 00:08:20.154
A što ćeš ti učiniti po tom
pitanju, kapetane Tipkovnico?

121
00:08:20.292 --> 00:08:22.778
Hutch, stani u red,
bezobrazna budalo.

122
00:08:22.916 --> 00:08:24.093
Tako razgovaramo s damom?

123
00:08:24.193 --> 00:08:25.163
Treneru, ja ću to--
Šuti, Jesse.

124
00:08:25.263 --> 00:08:26.298
Ovako se ne

125
00:08:26.436 --> 00:08:28.097
predstavljamo
u mojoj momčadi.

126
00:08:28.197 --> 00:08:30.809
Ispričavam se, gospođice.

127
00:08:40.209 --> 00:08:41.659
Pardon tebi.

128
00:08:41.797 --> 00:08:44.443
Trebali su me prebaciti u bolju klasu.

129
00:09:08.099 --> 00:09:09.552
Ventilator recirkulacije je prijavljen.

130
00:09:09.652 --> 00:09:12.436
Ne smijemo legalno poletjeti
dok ga ne poprave.

131
00:09:13.725 --> 00:09:15.658
Samo sam ga resetirao.

132
00:09:17.004 --> 00:09:18.872
To ne znači da opet neće
crknuti kasnije.

133
00:09:18.972 --> 00:09:19.942
Bok. Dobro došli.

134
00:09:20.042 --> 00:09:21.077
Samo desno.

135
00:09:21.215 --> 00:09:23.739
Dovoljno ste nas dugo držali da čekamo.

136
00:09:23.839 --> 00:09:24.805
Što ima, buraz?

137
00:09:24.943 --> 00:09:26.117
Da, dobro. Evo ga.

138
00:09:27.221 --> 00:09:28.429
Da. Ovdje možeš...

139
00:09:28.568 --> 00:09:29.741
Hej, dobro sam.

140
00:09:36.576 --> 00:09:37.507
Sjednimo.

141
00:09:37.646 --> 00:09:39.095
Hajde. Sjednimo.

142
00:09:39.233 --> 00:09:40.994
Hoćeš se vezati?

143
00:09:41.132 --> 00:09:42.274
Dobar dan, putnici.

144
00:09:42.374 --> 00:09:45.067
Zovem se Penny, i u ime
Northeastern Airlinesa

145
00:09:45.205 --> 00:09:46.589
želim vam
dobrodošlicu...

146
00:09:46.689 --> 00:09:48.108
Prolazimo. Ispričavam se.
Ne dajte da vas prekidamo.

147
00:09:48.208 --> 00:09:50.417
Oprostite. Kao da nismo bili ovdje.

148
00:09:50.555 --> 00:09:52.457
Gospodine, molim vas,
možete li uspraviti sjedalo?

149
00:09:52.557 --> 00:09:55.253
Naravno. Želim vam dobrodošlicu
na let N-140... Koji ti je profil?

150
00:09:55.353 --> 00:09:57.117
...koji polijeće iz LAX-a
i slijeće u Šangaj.

151
00:09:57.217 --> 00:09:58.839
Hvala. Uskoro ćemo započeti

152
00:09:58.977 --> 00:10:00.358
postupak
polijetanja.

153
00:10:00.496 --> 00:10:01.949
Stoga vas sada
molimo da sjednete

154
00:10:02.049 --> 00:10:05.420
i provjerite jesu li pojasevi
sigurno zakopčani.

155
00:10:09.539 --> 00:10:12.508
Northeastern 140, danas
polijećete s piste 24-L.

156
00:10:12.646 --> 00:10:13.961
Kontrolna lista prije polijetanja.

157
00:10:14.061 --> 00:10:15.753
Zakrilca.

158
00:10:15.891 --> 00:10:18.364
Što misliš,
gdje su postavljena?

159
00:10:18.963 --> 00:10:20.274
Trebam samo odgovor.

160
00:10:20.412 --> 00:10:21.655
Znaš, Bene,

161
00:10:21.793 --> 00:10:24.624
da nas FAA tjera
da stalno potvrđujemo zakrilca

162
00:10:24.762 --> 00:10:28.493
samo zato što su oni idioti
na Delti 1141 toliko laprdali o tome

163
00:10:28.593 --> 00:10:30.081
koju bi stjuardesu
htjeli kresnuti

164
00:10:30.181 --> 00:10:31.565
da su ih zaboravili provjeriti.

165
00:10:31.665 --> 00:10:33.222
Kapetane,
trebam samo odgovor.

166
00:10:33.322 --> 00:10:35.565
Zakrilca su na pet, Bene.

167
00:10:35.704 --> 00:10:39.661
Isto mjesto kao zadnja
tri puta kad smo ih provjerili.

168
00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:41.364
Northeastern 140,

169
00:10:41.502 --> 00:10:43.815
odobreno vam je
polijetanje, 24-L.

170
00:10:43.953 --> 00:10:47.324
Odobreno polijetanje 24 lijevo,
Northeastern 140.

171
00:11:15.502 --> 00:11:16.883
Vidimo se.
Kapetane.

172
00:11:21.508 --> 00:11:25.776
Izgledalo je kao da si me htio
udariti zbog one provjere zakrilaca.

173
00:11:26.409 --> 00:11:28.515
To mi baš ne bi pomoglo
u karijeri.

174
00:11:28.653 --> 00:11:30.862
Nisi li tako izbačen
iz Zračnih snaga?

175
00:11:31.967 --> 00:11:34.141
Pa, taj viši časnik
je to zaslužio.

176
00:11:35.211 --> 00:11:37.835
Ti si samo,
ti si naporan.

177
00:11:37.973 --> 00:11:40.665
Spiskao si mirovinu
i beneficije.

178
00:11:40.803 --> 00:11:44.186
Teško je to sa ženom
i malom djecom.

179
00:11:44.324 --> 00:11:47.365
Morao si se uhvatiti za neku
jadnu regionalnu kompaniju

180
00:11:47.465 --> 00:11:50.748
i sad si u tom sjedalu kad bi,
naravno, trebao biti u mojem,

181
00:11:50.848 --> 00:11:54.058
i misliš da si više ne možeš
priuštiti kršiti pravila.

182
00:11:54.196 --> 00:11:55.300
Pa, Bene,

183
00:11:57.647 --> 00:11:59.235
ja sigurno neću reći.

184
00:12:02.445 --> 00:12:04.451
Znači mogao sam te tresnuti
i izvući se?

185
00:12:07.692 --> 00:12:08.831
Ja bih te cinkao.

186
00:12:08.969 --> 00:12:09.970
Znam da bi.

187
00:12:17.357 --> 00:12:19.117
Bez leda? Mhm.

188
00:12:36.445 --> 00:12:38.209
Što ima?

189
00:12:38.309 --> 00:12:39.275
Ništa posebno.

190
00:12:42.658 --> 00:12:45.419
Unuka mi
živi u Šangaju.

191
00:12:47.042 --> 00:12:49.239
Super.

192
00:13:11.756 --> 00:13:15.795
Bene, ovaj, samo sam htjela
pitati kako ti je sin.

193
00:13:16.968 --> 00:13:20.098
Čula sam da je u zadnje
vrijeme prilično bolestan.

194
00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:26.529
Sigurno je teško tvojoj ženi,
pogotovo kad ti radiš i sve to.

195
00:13:26.667 --> 00:13:30.108
Da, pa, Nadineina obitelj živi blizu.

196
00:13:30.568 --> 00:13:31.880
Pomažu kad me nema.

197
00:13:35.504 --> 00:13:36.470
Koji kurac?

198
00:13:56.249 --> 00:13:59.562
O, kvragu.

199
00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:03.950
Statistika kaže da turbulencija
nikad nije srušila avion.

200
00:14:04.050 --> 00:14:05.706
To bi trebalo
biti utješno?

201
00:14:05.845 --> 00:14:08.330
Dobro sam. Samo sam
prolila gin-tonic

202
00:14:08.468 --> 00:14:10.976
kad mi najviše treba.

203
00:14:17.891 --> 00:14:18.965
Dobar dan, gospodine.

204
00:14:19.065 --> 00:14:21.308
Hej, pogodi što mi treba.

205
00:14:21.446 --> 00:14:23.793
Žao mi je.
Nestalo nam je čepića za uši.

206
00:14:23.932 --> 00:14:25.105
Savršeno.

207
00:14:25.243 --> 00:14:26.727
Baš savršeno.

208
00:14:26.866 --> 00:14:29.665
Što, sad ćete na kapaljku dijeliti
i toaletni papir, ha?

209
00:14:29.765 --> 00:14:31.215
Nevjerojatni ste!

210
00:14:32.319 --> 00:14:34.563
Gospodine, ne smijete to!

211
00:14:37.393 --> 00:14:38.360
Ne čujem vas.

212
00:14:39.361 --> 00:14:41.558
Da.

213
00:14:52.857 --> 00:14:53.962
Što?

214
00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:56.481
Daleko iznad tvoje lige.

215
00:14:56.619 --> 00:14:58.104
O, ne. Ne, nisam.

216
00:14:58.242 --> 00:14:59.968
Čekaj. Stvarno?

217
00:15:00.106 --> 00:15:02.073
Ona je čvrsta devetka.

218
00:15:02.211 --> 00:15:05.249
Mrzim ti to reći,
ali ti si petica.

219
00:15:05.387 --> 00:15:08.462
Možda bi se mogao
dotjerati do šestice,

220
00:15:08.562 --> 00:15:09.943
ali to je velikodušno.

221
00:15:10.979 --> 00:15:12.532
O.

222
00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:16.225
Rastura me Betsy Ross ovdje straga.

223
00:15:16.363 --> 00:15:18.162
Čekaj, a što ako imam
sjajnu osobnost?

224
00:15:18.262 --> 00:15:19.194
Nemaš.

225
00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:22.404
O.

226
00:17:18.106 --> 00:17:19.935
Cora, dušo.

227
00:17:20.073 --> 00:17:24.250
Znam da su promjene
strašne, dobro?

228
00:17:24.388 --> 00:17:26.873
Ali Finn se stvarno
ugleda na tebe.

229
00:17:27.011 --> 00:17:30.773
Pa bi li te ubilo
da budeš samo malo ljubaznija?

230
00:18:10.468 --> 00:18:11.400
Hej, ja sam.

231
00:19:14.843 --> 00:19:17.040
Cora.

232
00:19:18.226 --> 00:19:19.230
Gdje su mama i tata?

233
00:19:19.330 --> 00:19:21.229
Otišli su na bazen
plivati.

234
00:19:21.367 --> 00:19:23.196
U avionu postoji bazen?

235
00:19:23.334 --> 00:19:25.785
Da. Da, tamo je straga.

236
00:20:05.376 --> 00:20:08.575
Hej, mali,
ne možeš naći svoje mjesto?

237
00:20:08.862 --> 00:20:10.864
O, voliš igrice, ha?

238
00:20:11.002 --> 00:20:13.384
Dobro. Hoćeš mi
pokazati kako se to radi?

239
00:20:13.522 --> 00:20:15.766
Da? Hajde. Evo.

240
00:20:17.112 --> 00:20:19.010
Dobro. Desna ruka
ide ovdje...

241
00:20:34.509 --> 00:20:36.031
Poništavam glavno upozorenje

242
00:20:36.131 --> 00:20:37.136
za požar u prednjem
teretnom prostoru. Potvrdi.

243
00:20:37.236 --> 00:20:38.478
Potvrđeno.

244
00:20:38.616 --> 00:20:40.553
Idemo memorijske postupke
za požar prednjeg tereta.

245
00:20:40.653 --> 00:20:42.417
Razumijem. Prekidač požara
prednjeg tereta uključen.

246
00:20:42.517 --> 00:20:43.590
Potvrdi.
Potvrđeno.

247
00:20:43.690 --> 00:20:44.902
Pražnjenje boce za gašenje uključeno.

248
00:20:45.002 --> 00:20:47.146
Potvrdi.
Potvrđeno.

249
00:20:59.637 --> 00:21:01.332
Pan, pan, pan.
Northeastern 140.

250
00:21:01.432 --> 00:21:03.541
Imamo indikaciju požara
u prednjem teretnom prostoru

251
00:21:03.641 --> 00:21:04.646
i detektiran je dim.

252
00:21:04.746 --> 00:21:05.957
Trebamo kurs
prema najbližoj

253
00:21:06.057 --> 00:21:08.132
prikladnoj zračnoj luci,
Northeastern 140.

254
00:21:08.232 --> 00:21:10.752
Northeastern 140,
ovdje KZAK Oakland.

255
00:21:10.890 --> 00:21:12.792
Najbliža zračna luka
je Guam International.

256
00:21:12.892 --> 00:21:15.204
Četiristo nautičkih milja južno.

257
00:21:15.343 --> 00:21:16.347
Vratimo kapetana
ovamo.

258
00:21:16.447 --> 00:21:17.448
Razumijem.

259
00:21:17.586 --> 00:21:18.901
Razumijem, KZAK.
Northeastern 140.

260
00:21:19.001 --> 00:21:23.581
Sada idemo direktno za Guam, spuštamo
se na 10.000 stopa, Northeastern 140.

261
00:21:28.494 --> 00:21:29.360
Jesi dobro, dušo?

262
00:21:29.460 --> 00:21:31.013
Da, dobro sam.

263
00:21:34.741 --> 00:21:35.915
Bene, što imamo?

264
00:21:36.053 --> 00:21:37.575
Požar u prednjem teretnom prostoru.

265
00:21:37.675 --> 00:21:39.094
Završili smo
memorijske postupke.

266
00:21:39.194 --> 00:21:40.233
Boce za gašenje
se ne prazne.

267
00:21:40.333 --> 00:21:42.097
Proglasio sam izvanredno stanje.

268
00:21:42.197 --> 00:21:43.236
Spuštamo se na 10.000,

269
00:21:43.336 --> 00:21:45.273
preusmjeravamo se
na Guam International.

270
00:21:45.373 --> 00:21:47.616
Siđi dolje. Ugasi ga.

271
00:21:48.237 --> 00:21:49.273
Razumijem.

272
00:22:14.333 --> 00:22:15.299
Tata?

273
00:22:17.197 --> 00:22:19.924
Tata? Jesi li unutra?

274
00:22:52.094 --> 00:22:55.051
Požar se pretvorio
u eksploziju.

275
00:23:03.312 --> 00:23:04.348
Koji vrag?

276
00:23:16.325 --> 00:23:17.706
Izgubili smo kabinu.

277
00:23:17.844 --> 00:23:19.156
Ovo ne ide nabolje.

278
00:23:19.294 --> 00:23:20.778
Spuštam je.

279
00:23:27.544 --> 00:23:29.200
Hajde! Hajde, zgrabite ih.

280
00:23:29.338 --> 00:23:30.443
Stavite to, hajde.

281
00:23:37.692 --> 00:23:39.141
Stavi ovo. Dobro?

282
00:23:43.076 --> 00:23:44.181
Rich, stavi masku.

283
00:23:44.319 --> 00:23:46.255
Bene, bit ćemo
poravnati na 10.000

284
00:23:46.355 --> 00:23:47.567
prije nego što je
uopće stigneš staviti.

285
00:23:47.667 --> 00:23:49.220
Zoe, masku!

286
00:24:06.893 --> 00:24:08.861
11.000, za 10.000.

287
00:24:08.999 --> 00:24:11.196
Još tisuću.

288
00:24:11.380 --> 00:24:13.210
Ravno na 10.000.

289
00:24:13.348 --> 00:24:14.660
Vidim 10.000.

290
00:24:21.943 --> 00:24:25.429
Stabilni smo.
Instrumenti reagiraju.

291
00:24:25.567 --> 00:24:27.711
Preuzmi avion.
Ja ću se obratiti putnicima.

292
00:24:27.811 --> 00:24:29.678
Moj avion. Potvrđeno.

293
00:24:29.778 --> 00:24:31.090
Tvoj avion. Potvrđeno.

294
00:24:33.472 --> 00:24:35.577
Ljudi, govori vam
kapetan.

295
00:24:35.715 --> 00:24:39.098
Imamo požar
u teretnom prostoru.

296
00:24:39.236 --> 00:24:41.000
Spustili smo se
na sigurnu visinu

297
00:24:41.100 --> 00:24:44.897
i preusmjerili se prema
zračnoj luci Guam International.

298
00:24:45.035 --> 00:24:47.106
Vrlo je važno da
svi ostanete mirni.

299
00:24:50.627 --> 00:24:53.077
Oprostite. Oprostite.

300
00:24:53.215 --> 00:24:54.251
Odmah se vraćam.

301
00:24:54.389 --> 00:24:56.360
Svi trebate slijediti upute svojih
članova kabinskog osoblja...

302
00:24:56.460 --> 00:24:57.392
Samo trenutak.

303
00:24:57.530 --> 00:24:58.707
...dok putnike blizu

304
00:24:58.807 --> 00:25:00.468
zahvaćenog područja
premještamo na sigurnija sjedala.

305
00:25:00.568 --> 00:25:02.397
Lisa.

306
00:25:02.535 --> 00:25:04.019
Straga ima još
sjedala!

307
00:25:05.020 --> 00:25:06.612
Ovuda, gospodine!
Idite, idite!

308
00:25:06.712 --> 00:25:09.300
Ne, ne! Ne mičite se
ako ne morate!

309
00:25:09.438 --> 00:25:10.957
Lisa!

310
00:25:11.095 --> 00:25:13.166
Oslobodite prolaz!

311
00:25:25.213 --> 00:25:26.114
Moji roditelji!

312
00:25:26.214 --> 00:25:28.147
Ne sada. Ostani ovdje.

313
00:25:57.072 --> 00:25:58.042
Izgubili smo motor jedan.

314
00:25:58.142 --> 00:25:59.868
Gospodine, ne smijete to!

315
00:26:00.006 --> 00:26:01.421
Zbog toga se brineš?

316
00:26:01.560 --> 00:26:04.447
Vratite se na svoje mjesto odmah!

317
00:26:27.689 --> 00:26:29.346
Kontrole leta ne reagiraju.

318
00:26:29.484 --> 00:26:30.419
Hidraulika je otišla.

319
00:26:30.519 --> 00:26:32.145
Ne govori mi što je pokvareno.

320
00:26:32.245 --> 00:26:34.044
Reci mi što još radi
na ovom avionu.

321
00:26:34.144 --> 00:26:37.357
Imaš ručne sajle prema vanjskim
krilcima, elevatoru i kormilu pravca.

322
00:26:37.457 --> 00:26:38.666
Krenimo na to.

323
00:26:38.804 --> 00:26:40.257
Mayday, Mayday, Mayday!
Northeastern 140.

324
00:26:40.357 --> 00:26:41.910
Izgubili smo motor jedan.

325
00:26:42.048 --> 00:26:43.881
140, Guam International
i dalje je najbliža opcija.

326
00:26:43.981 --> 00:26:45.776
Trebamo nešto bliže.

327
00:26:45.914 --> 00:26:49.734
140, nemamo ništa.
Iznad otvorenog ste oceana.

328
00:26:58.824 --> 00:27:01.033
Pomozite nam! Upomoć!

329
00:27:09.869 --> 00:27:11.530
Kazaljke instrumenata
sve padaju na nulu.

330
00:27:11.630 --> 00:27:12.738
Na rezervnim smo instrumentima.

331
00:27:12.838 --> 00:27:14.222
Mayday, Mayday, Mayday!

332
00:27:14.322 --> 00:27:15.568
Ovdje Northeastern 140.

333
00:27:15.668 --> 00:27:19.281
Izgubili smo napajanje.
Kapetane, izgubili smo radio.

334
00:27:20.811 --> 00:27:22.779
Zaustavi APU.
Razumijem.

335
00:27:27.715 --> 00:27:30.131
U redu je. Samo se drži, dobro?

336
00:27:31.753 --> 00:27:32.789
Pritisni opet.

337
00:27:33.824 --> 00:27:35.723
Ništa.
Opet!

338
00:27:35.861 --> 00:27:37.590
APU se ne pokreće.
Na 6.000 stopa smo.

339
00:27:37.690 --> 00:27:39.281
Pokušaj ručno izbaciti RAT.

340
00:27:39.381 --> 00:27:42.235
Ram air turbina. Potvrđeno.

341
00:27:49.426 --> 00:27:52.567
Ram air turbina radi.
Instrumenti su opet online.

342
00:27:52.705 --> 00:27:54.676
Ponovno upali motor.

343
00:27:54.776 --> 00:27:56.885
Paljenje.

344
00:27:56.985 --> 00:27:58.159
Pritisni opet.

345
00:28:05.684 --> 00:28:07.306
Ne!

346
00:28:08.963 --> 00:28:11.068
Tata! Gdje si?

347
00:28:11.206 --> 00:28:13.074
Ne, ne, ne.
Čekaj, čekaj. Dođi ovamo.

348
00:28:13.174 --> 00:28:14.934
Pusti me! Pusti me!

349
00:28:16.971 --> 00:28:18.248
Bit ćemo dobro.

350
00:28:18.386 --> 00:28:19.318
Pokušaj opet.

351
00:28:22.355 --> 00:28:23.460
Ne radi.

352
00:28:23.598 --> 00:28:25.465
Nemamo dovoljno
brzine za ponovno paljenje.

353
00:28:25.565 --> 00:28:28.936
A nemamo ni prostora
za poniranje i ubrzanje.

354
00:28:30.709 --> 00:28:32.331
Sletjet ćemo na vodu.

355
00:28:32.469 --> 00:28:33.850
Počni ispuštati gorivo.

356
00:28:33.988 --> 00:28:34.958
Odustajemo
od ponovnog paljenja?

357
00:28:35.058 --> 00:28:38.222
Učini to! Odmah!
Ispuštam gorivo.

358
00:28:40.339 --> 00:28:41.858
Ovdje
kapetan.

359
00:28:41.996 --> 00:28:43.860
Pripremite se za udar.

360
00:28:52.316 --> 00:28:55.595
Priprema! Priprema!
Glave dolje! Ostanite dolje!

361
00:28:56.493 --> 00:28:59.496
Priprema! Glave dolje!

362
00:29:00.808 --> 00:29:02.671
Dobro, dobro.
Dolje! Dolje!

363
00:29:22.243 --> 00:29:24.555
Bene, želim očitanja visine i brzine

364
00:29:24.693 --> 00:29:26.385
svakih tisuću stopa.

365
00:29:26.523 --> 00:29:27.735
3.000 stopa, brzina 220.

366
00:29:27.835 --> 00:29:28.939
Prebrzo, kvragu.

367
00:29:30.561 --> 00:29:32.356
Vizualno vidim
valove.

368
00:29:32.494 --> 00:29:33.564
Moramo desno.

369
00:29:35.670 --> 00:29:38.055
Rich, lista kaže da samo
idemo paralelno s valovima.

370
00:29:38.155 --> 00:29:39.570
Valovi nisu tako loši.

371
00:29:39.708 --> 00:29:41.231
Želim sav čeoni vjetar
koji mogu dobiti

372
00:29:41.331 --> 00:29:43.026
da smanjim vertikalnu brzinu spuštanja.

373
00:29:43.126 --> 00:29:45.235
Rich, ako se nagnemo krilom i
zakačimo vrhom, prevrnut ćemo se.

374
00:29:45.335 --> 00:29:48.065
A ako udarim u vodu prebrzo,
sigurno smo gotovi.

375
00:29:48.165 --> 00:29:50.823
Samo mi reci kamo
vjetar nosi te valove.

376
00:29:50.961 --> 00:29:54.896
Rich, okreni avion.

377
00:29:55.034 --> 00:29:57.519
Sletjet ćemo paralelno
s valovima.

378
00:29:57.657 --> 00:29:59.970
Moramo desno
30 stupnjeva. Potvrdi?

379
00:30:01.972 --> 00:30:02.939
Potvrđeno.

380
00:30:05.389 --> 00:30:06.735
Namjesti mi taj kurs.

381
00:30:06.874 --> 00:30:07.806
Razumijem.

382
00:30:09.911 --> 00:30:11.913
2.000 stopa. Brzina 190.

383
00:30:12.051 --> 00:30:13.401
Hoćeš zakrilca?
Koliko god možeš dati.

384
00:30:13.501 --> 00:30:15.940
Zakrilca na maksimumu.

385
00:30:17.919 --> 00:30:20.266
1.000 stopa. Brzina 180.
Još prebrzo.

386
00:30:21.785 --> 00:30:22.855
Brzina 170.

387
00:30:23.787 --> 00:30:24.792
Stajni trap uvučen.

388
00:30:24.892 --> 00:30:26.583
Gašenje požara APU-a.

389
00:30:28.067 --> 00:30:29.448
Pazi na krila.

390
00:30:29.586 --> 00:30:31.139
300 stopa.

391
00:30:31.277 --> 00:30:34.215
Brzina još 170. Bene...
pomakni sjedalo skroz unatrag.

392
00:30:34.315 --> 00:30:35.661
Zategni pojas.

393
00:30:35.799 --> 00:30:37.908
Rich, drži to krilo gore.

394
00:30:38.008 --> 00:30:39.807
Navodim te lijevo
10 stupnjeva.

395
00:30:39.907 --> 00:30:41.356
Rep dolje.

396
00:30:41.494 --> 00:30:43.899
Rep dolje. 100 stopa.

397
00:30:47.328 --> 00:30:49.123
Hajde, curo, surađuj sa mnom.

398
00:31:11.559 --> 00:31:14.723
Bene, pomakni sjedalo
skroz unatrag. Učini to!

399
00:31:16.702 --> 00:31:19.245
Pripremite se za udar!

400
00:31:29.784 --> 00:31:31.199
O, sranje!

401
00:32:52.487 --> 00:32:53.454
Pomozite mi!

402
00:32:53.592 --> 00:32:55.214
Upomoć!

403
00:32:55.870 --> 00:32:57.251
Molim vas!

404
00:32:58.390 --> 00:33:00.150
Netko!
Upomoć!

405
00:33:04.258 --> 00:33:05.949
Netko!

406
00:33:07.364 --> 00:33:09.263
Upomoć!

407
00:33:23.760 --> 00:33:25.957
Rich!

408
00:33:27.453 --> 00:33:29.321
Probudi se, Rich.

409
00:33:29.421 --> 00:33:31.250
Uspio si.

410
00:33:31.388 --> 00:33:32.634
Da nije bilo
tog koraljnog grebena,

411
00:33:32.734 --> 00:33:35.810
sad bismo otvarali šampanjac.
upravo sada.

412
00:33:41.950 --> 00:33:43.607
Jesi dobro?
Da.

413
00:33:47.404 --> 00:33:48.405
Dobro.

414
00:33:51.995 --> 00:33:54.101
Hej! Hej.

415
00:34:22.543 --> 00:34:24.445
Ostani ovdje, dobro?
Odmah se vraćam.

416
00:34:24.545 --> 00:34:26.305
Dobro, dobro.
Dobro?

417
00:34:38.110 --> 00:34:40.319
O, Bože. Rich!

418
00:34:40.457 --> 00:34:41.600
Primite ga za ruke.

419
00:34:41.700 --> 00:34:44.085
Pokušat ću ga osloboditi, dobro?

420
00:34:44.185 --> 00:34:46.049
Jedan, dva, tri.

421
00:34:46.187 --> 00:34:47.706
Ne, ne, ne!

422
00:34:47.844 --> 00:34:50.022
Stani!
To neće upaliti.

423
00:34:50.122 --> 00:34:51.399
Hej.

424
00:34:51.537 --> 00:34:52.849
Bit ćeš dobro, Rich.

425
00:34:52.987 --> 00:34:54.678
Izvući ćemo te
odavde.

426
00:34:54.816 --> 00:34:58.199
Ljudi, nemamo puno vremena.

427
00:34:58.337 --> 00:35:00.653
Polako, Rich. Noga ti je prikliještena.

428
00:35:00.753 --> 00:35:02.307
Sjekira za nesreće.
Što?

429
00:35:03.825 --> 00:35:05.037
Nemoj ni pomišljati.

430
00:35:05.137 --> 00:35:08.416
Ne, nećeš mi uzeti nogu.
Ne još.

431
00:35:08.554 --> 00:35:11.097
Možeš je upotrijebiti da me izvučeš.

432
00:36:28.393 --> 00:36:29.325
Lisa.

433
00:36:30.705 --> 00:36:31.637
Lisa.

434
00:36:33.398 --> 00:36:35.507
Lisa!

435
00:36:35.607 --> 00:36:37.770
Lisa!

436
00:36:41.371 --> 00:36:43.569
Lisa!

437
00:36:47.860 --> 00:36:49.137
Lisa!

438
00:37:13.127 --> 00:37:15.405
Hej, mali. Hej, hej.

439
00:37:16.510 --> 00:37:19.202
Dobro? Da? Dobro.

440
00:37:19.340 --> 00:37:20.997
Moram ovo skinuti.

441
00:37:21.135 --> 00:37:22.757
Dobro. U redu, u redu.

442
00:37:23.586 --> 00:37:25.208
Dobro si.

443
00:37:25.346 --> 00:37:28.337
Dođi ovamo. Pogledaj me.
U redu je. Da?

444
00:37:31.421 --> 00:37:32.905
Halo? Ima li koga?

445
00:37:33.699 --> 00:37:34.666
Halo?

446
00:37:36.392 --> 00:37:38.290
Halo! Ima li koga?

447
00:37:39.153 --> 00:37:40.603
Ovdje sam!
Hej.

448
00:37:41.362 --> 00:37:42.329
Drži se.

449
00:37:42.467 --> 00:37:43.920
Dobro. Da.
Netko je ovdje?

450
00:37:44.020 --> 00:37:44.986
Netko je ovdje.

451
00:37:46.816 --> 00:37:48.335
Ona fina gospođa.
Doći će.

452
00:37:48.473 --> 00:37:50.444
Pomoći će nam.
Da? Ona zna što treba.

453
00:37:50.544 --> 00:37:51.890
Dobro.
Da.

454
00:38:45.978 --> 00:38:47.117
Diši, diši, diši.

455
00:38:48.912 --> 00:38:49.879
U redu je.

456
00:38:59.337 --> 00:39:00.338
Ne oslobađa se.

457
00:39:01.304 --> 00:39:02.478
Gubiš puno krvi.

458
00:39:05.998 --> 00:39:07.275
Ljudi, moramo brzo.

459
00:39:08.242 --> 00:39:10.405
Zarobljen je.

460
00:39:14.075 --> 00:39:16.046
Nema drugog načina.

461
00:39:16.146 --> 00:39:17.355
Iskrvarit će.

462
00:39:17.493 --> 00:39:19.667
Bene, nema koristi.

463
00:39:19.805 --> 00:39:20.979
Ne budi papak.

464
00:39:21.117 --> 00:39:22.808
Kako god, ja sam gotov

465
00:39:24.016 --> 00:39:25.811
i točno sam
gdje pripadam.

466
00:39:25.949 --> 00:39:27.989
Nemoj mi s tim sranjem
„gdje pripadam”.

467
00:39:28.089 --> 00:39:29.957
Ako ostaneš ovdje, umireš.
Izađite. Oboje.

468
00:39:30.057 --> 00:39:31.369
Zaključajte vrata.

469
00:39:31.507 --> 00:39:33.750
Ako budu otvorena
kad ova voda provali,

470
00:39:33.888 --> 00:39:37.102
poplavit ćemo cijelu pilotsku
kabinu i povući sve na dno.

471
00:39:37.202 --> 00:39:38.445
Uzet ću ti nogu.

472
00:39:38.583 --> 00:39:40.623
Nećeš spasiti nijedan život
ako se utopiš ovdje

473
00:39:40.723 --> 00:39:45.095
s nekim kretenom koji uvijek
odbija slijediti običan protokol.

474
00:39:49.421 --> 00:39:51.043
Tvoj je avion, Bene.

475
00:39:51.181 --> 00:39:52.631
Ne ostavljam te, Rich.

476
00:39:54.081 --> 00:39:55.116
Ne ostavljam te.

477
00:39:58.706 --> 00:39:59.983
Potvrdi.

478
00:40:12.927 --> 00:40:14.619
Potvrđeno.
Idi kući, Bene.

479
00:40:15.343 --> 00:40:17.610
Budi sa svojim sinom.

480
00:40:29.910 --> 00:40:32.107
Hvala.

481
00:40:38.228 --> 00:40:40.472
Bene, ELT. Provjeri ELT.

482
00:40:51.794 --> 00:40:53.761
Dušo. O, dušo.

483
00:40:57.662 --> 00:40:58.594
U redu je.

484
00:40:59.526 --> 00:41:00.699
U redu je.

485
00:41:00.837 --> 00:41:02.321
Hoćeš li doći
i sjesti?

486
00:41:31.040 --> 00:41:32.317
Penny.

487
00:41:32.455 --> 00:41:33.421
Pomozi mi.

488
00:41:34.181 --> 00:41:35.423
Podigni je.

489
00:41:48.540 --> 00:41:50.646
Jesi dobro? Da?
Da.

490
00:42:32.826 --> 00:42:35.023
Declan.

491
00:42:37.382 --> 00:42:39.457
Declan. Declan, probudi se!

492
00:42:39.557 --> 00:42:41.700
Declan, probudi se!

493
00:42:41.800 --> 00:42:42.732
Sranje.

494
00:42:44.216 --> 00:42:45.428
Koji se kurac događa?

495
00:42:45.528 --> 00:42:47.254
Čekaj, jesi li dobro?
Djeca.

496
00:42:47.392 --> 00:42:49.152
Jebote. Moramo
izaći odavde.

497
00:42:49.290 --> 00:42:50.498
Ne! Declane, nemoj!

498
00:44:01.259 --> 00:44:02.329
Što da radimo?

499
00:44:03.157 --> 00:44:04.503
Naći preživjele.

500
00:44:04.642 --> 00:44:07.322
I dohvatiti onaj ELT odašiljač.

501
00:44:10.613 --> 00:44:12.615
Becky.
Mislim da ima puls.

502
00:44:12.753 --> 00:44:13.858
Becky.

503
00:44:13.996 --> 00:44:14.928
Hajde.

504
00:44:15.066 --> 00:44:17.171
Becky, probudi se!

505
00:44:17.309 --> 00:44:18.590
Moramo se odmah micati!

506
00:44:18.690 --> 00:44:20.957
Becky!
Voda se diže.

507
00:44:21.969 --> 00:44:23.212
Možeš je pomaknuti?

508
00:44:23.350 --> 00:44:24.523
Ima, ono, 70 kila.

509
00:44:24.662 --> 00:44:27.703
Mogu se služiti samo jednom rukom
i moram je odvući sve tamo gore?

510
00:44:27.803 --> 00:44:29.667
70 kila? Stvarno?

511
00:44:32.186 --> 00:44:33.153
Ja sam...

512
00:44:33.981 --> 00:44:34.948
baka.

513
00:44:37.640 --> 00:44:39.884
Onaj kome ću pomoći
je ovaj mali ovdje.

514
00:44:41.057 --> 00:44:42.852
Idemo.
Ja se mogu penjati.

515
00:44:42.990 --> 00:44:45.510
Dobro se penjem.
Pokaži što znaš, frajeru.

516
00:44:46.373 --> 00:44:48.202
Dobro. Da.

517
00:44:50.791 --> 00:44:53.437
Koliko će proći prije nego nas nađu?

518
00:44:54.864 --> 00:44:57.315
Može biti sat vremena
ili nekoliko sati.

519
00:45:00.767 --> 00:45:01.771
Ako su dobili signal.

520
00:45:01.871 --> 00:45:02.976
„Ako”?

521
00:45:04.460 --> 00:45:07.451
Ako se ELT aktivirao
kad smo pali.

522
00:45:07.981 --> 00:45:09.016
A ako nije?

523
00:45:12.813 --> 00:45:14.746
Da.

524
00:45:14.884 --> 00:45:16.679
Zato idem
malo plivati.

525
00:45:18.163 --> 00:45:19.751
U srednjem je dijelu.

526
00:45:19.889 --> 00:45:22.650
Uzeo bih splav,
ali možda će vam trebati.

527
00:45:24.031 --> 00:45:24.963
Pusti mene.

528
00:45:26.068 --> 00:45:27.759
Waikiki Roughwater.
Triput.

529
00:45:29.865 --> 00:45:32.143
Mogu ja to, dobro? Vjeruj mi.

530
00:45:33.523 --> 00:45:35.594
Da.
Kamo ideš?

531
00:45:35.733 --> 00:45:37.665
Ovaj... U sredinu
aviona.

532
00:45:38.943 --> 00:45:41.451
Jesu li moja mama i tata ondje?

533
00:45:44.155 --> 00:45:45.225
Želim s tobom.

534
00:45:45.363 --> 00:45:47.227
Pa, moram plivati, dušo.

535
00:45:47.365 --> 00:45:49.781
Znam plivati.
Predaleko je.

536
00:45:49.919 --> 00:45:52.373
Dobro? Ali potražit ću
tvoje roditelje, obećavam.

537
00:45:52.473 --> 00:45:54.234
I mog malog brata, Finna.

538
00:45:54.372 --> 00:45:55.753
Zove se Finn.

539
00:45:56.408 --> 00:45:57.340
Penny.

540
00:45:58.445 --> 00:46:01.793
Kad izađeš tamo, daj
znak da potvrdiš... Dobro.

541
00:46:01.931 --> 00:46:03.415
...da ELT radi,
u redu?

542
00:46:03.553 --> 00:46:06.177
Ovo ide u zapisnik, zar ne?

543
00:46:06.315 --> 00:46:09.513
Dovoljno dobro za pursera.
Glavnog pursera.

544
00:46:09.836 --> 00:46:12.562
Evo, uzmi ovo.
Ne, samo će me usporiti.

545
00:46:14.254 --> 00:46:17.705
Hej. Možeš li mi ovo čuvati
dok se ne vratim?

546
00:46:19.397 --> 00:46:20.743
Hvala.

547
00:46:20.881 --> 00:46:22.576
U pretincu je iznad glave,
desna strana, red 20.

548
00:46:22.676 --> 00:46:24.091
Dobro.

549
00:46:24.229 --> 00:46:27.339
Samo pritisni prekidač i pazi
da lampica ostane upaljena, dobro?

550
00:46:27.439 --> 00:46:28.958
Hej, sretno.

551
00:46:38.554 --> 00:46:40.594
Naći ćemo
tvoju obitelj, Cora.

552
00:46:40.694 --> 00:46:41.626
Dobro?

553
00:46:52.671 --> 00:46:53.780
Možeš ti to, Becky.

554
00:46:53.880 --> 00:46:55.778
Odmah iza tebe, frajeru.

555
00:46:55.916 --> 00:46:57.607
Brine me ovaj
veliki klipan.

556
00:46:57.745 --> 00:46:59.782
Da. Super.

557
00:46:59.920 --> 00:47:02.267
Sad mi i Shelley Winters sere, ha?

558
00:47:03.959 --> 00:47:05.443
Daj da vidim.
Miruj.

559
00:47:06.306 --> 00:47:07.825
Stavi ruku ovdje, dobro?

560
00:47:19.215 --> 00:47:20.423
Gospodine.

561
00:47:32.642 --> 00:47:33.643
Morski pas.

562
00:47:33.781 --> 00:47:35.783
Morski pas!
Morski pas!

563
00:47:39.477 --> 00:47:41.272
Morski pas! Penny!

564
00:47:42.963 --> 00:47:45.069
Penny, morski pas!

565
00:47:46.691 --> 00:47:47.968
Penny!

566
00:47:51.075 --> 00:47:52.873
Ne!

567
00:47:52.973 --> 00:47:54.250
Morski pas! Penny!

568
00:47:55.424 --> 00:47:57.667
Penny! Morski pas!

569
00:47:57.805 --> 00:47:59.083
Morski pas!
Stavi ovo.

570
00:47:59.877 --> 00:48:00.878
Morski pas!

571
00:48:05.848 --> 00:48:08.253
Čekaj, cipele. Cipele.

572
00:48:09.300 --> 00:48:10.266
Hajde.

573
00:48:11.992 --> 00:48:13.442
Držite ruke
izvan vode.

574
00:48:14.719 --> 00:48:16.203
Ne! Stani!

575
00:48:16.341 --> 00:48:18.757
Što?
Ne izlazi se ovako?

576
00:48:18.896 --> 00:48:21.937
Aktivirati splav?
U zračnom smo džepu.

577
00:48:22.037 --> 00:48:23.076
Ako probiješ brtvu,
potonut ćemo.

578
00:48:23.176 --> 00:48:24.211
Ali...

579
00:48:28.802 --> 00:48:30.424
Da, dobro, dobro. Da.

580
00:48:31.805 --> 00:48:33.117
Pet.

581
00:48:33.945 --> 00:48:35.809
Oprosti. Dobro.

582
00:49:06.460 --> 00:49:07.461
Penny!

583
00:49:07.599 --> 00:49:09.705
Penny! Morski pas!

584
00:49:10.775 --> 00:49:12.225
Penny!

585
00:49:12.363 --> 00:49:13.536
Morski pas u vodi!

586
00:49:14.917 --> 00:49:15.953
Dolazimo!

587
00:49:17.989 --> 00:49:18.921
Penny!

588
00:49:20.888 --> 00:49:22.235
Penny! Morski pas!

589
00:49:27.654 --> 00:49:28.931
Pomozite mi!

590
00:49:31.796 --> 00:49:32.970
Penny!

591
00:49:35.800 --> 00:49:39.631
Penny! Penny, dolazimo!
Dolazimo!

592
00:49:43.808 --> 00:49:45.465
Hajde! Daj mi ruku!

593
00:49:49.434 --> 00:49:50.884
Penny.

594
00:49:51.022 --> 00:49:51.989
Penny.

595
00:50:29.233 --> 00:50:31.166
Tonemo.
Gdje smo, dovraga?

596
00:50:31.304 --> 00:50:32.305
Tonemo.

597
00:50:33.616 --> 00:50:34.755
Koji...

598
00:50:34.893 --> 00:50:36.412
Imaš veliku posjekotinu.

599
00:50:36.550 --> 00:50:39.611
Daj da ti pomognem.
Nije ništa.

600
00:50:57.537 --> 00:50:59.470
Plivaj prema meni! Prema meni!

601
00:51:03.819 --> 00:51:05.234
Ovdje. Držim te!

602
00:51:11.309 --> 00:51:12.690
Dođi ovamo.

603
00:51:16.142 --> 00:51:18.339
Jesi dobro?

604
00:51:43.514 --> 00:51:44.894
Kako je sad?

605
00:51:45.032 --> 00:51:45.964
Manje užasno.

606
00:51:47.207 --> 00:51:48.657
Hvala što si me zakrpao.

607
00:51:48.795 --> 00:51:51.337
I žao mi je zbog
onog s vratima.

608
00:51:51.487 --> 00:51:52.971
Da.

609
00:51:53.110 --> 00:51:54.663
Bit ćemo dobro.

610
00:51:55.698 --> 00:51:57.459
Moramo smiriti
ovoga malog.

611
00:51:57.597 --> 00:52:00.876
Inače ćemo ostati
bez zraka, i to jako brzo.

612
00:52:01.670 --> 00:52:03.867
Hej, hej, mali.

613
00:52:04.328 --> 00:52:05.398
Letiš s obitelji?

614
00:52:06.640 --> 00:52:09.229
S mamicom i novim tatom

615
00:52:10.023 --> 00:52:11.714
i sestrom, Corom.

616
00:52:11.852 --> 00:52:14.376
Dobro, onda ćemo ti
pomoći pronaći obitelj.

617
00:52:14.476 --> 00:52:15.894
Ja sam Matt. To je Becky.

618
00:52:15.994 --> 00:52:17.893
A ovo je...
Zoe.

619
00:52:18.031 --> 00:52:19.481
Zoe. Zoe.

620
00:52:23.140 --> 00:52:24.555
A ti si?

621
00:52:24.693 --> 00:52:26.695
Zovem se Finn.
Finn.

622
00:52:29.905 --> 00:52:31.979
Bit će sve u redu.
Sve će biti dobro.

623
00:52:32.079 --> 00:52:34.465
Prestani to govoriti
kad znaš da nije istina!

624
00:52:45.645 --> 00:52:48.095
Moramo se pomaknuti natrag. Ljudi!

625
00:52:48.820 --> 00:52:50.343
Moramo se pomaknuti natrag.

626
00:52:50.443 --> 00:52:51.858
Začepi, E-sport.

627
00:52:51.996 --> 00:52:53.135
Što ti znaš
o ičemu?

628
00:52:53.273 --> 00:52:56.437
Previše je
težine ovdje naprijed.

629
00:52:59.555 --> 00:53:00.556
Pomozite nam.

630
00:53:01.316 --> 00:53:02.458
Otvori oči, budalo.

631
00:53:02.558 --> 00:53:04.150
Zar ne vidiš da je
stjuard totalno spržen?

632
00:53:04.250 --> 00:53:06.773
Ostavi je na miru, dobro?
U šoku je.

633
00:53:06.873 --> 00:53:08.771
Daj da ti pomognem, dobro?

634
00:53:08.909 --> 00:53:11.809
Jeste li liječnik?
Ne, veterinarka sam.

635
00:53:11.947 --> 00:53:13.328
Sjajno.

636
00:53:13.466 --> 00:53:16.023
Stavite joj ovratnik.
Da se prestane lizati.

637
00:53:16.123 --> 00:53:19.234
Vidiš, zato više volim
životinje nego ljude.

638
00:53:22.785 --> 00:53:23.997
Nemamo puno vremena.

639
00:53:24.097 --> 00:53:25.171
Začepi. Samo začepi.

640
00:53:25.271 --> 00:53:26.551
Potonut ćemo.
Svi ćemo umrijeti!

641
00:53:26.651 --> 00:53:28.035
Što očekuješ
da napravimo?

642
00:53:28.135 --> 00:53:29.278
Pomaknite se natrag.

643
00:53:29.378 --> 00:53:30.931
Kamo?
U vodu.

644
00:53:31.069 --> 00:53:32.554
Skinite dio težine.

645
00:53:32.692 --> 00:53:35.453
Klinac ima pravo.
Ispod nas je koraljni greben.

646
00:53:35.591 --> 00:53:37.424
Možda će to skinuti
malo pritiska s njega.

647
00:53:37.524 --> 00:53:38.456
Onda ti idi.

648
00:53:38.594 --> 00:53:40.976
Jedna osoba
neće ništa promijeniti.

649
00:53:42.184 --> 00:53:43.327
Kako si me to nazvao?

650
00:53:43.427 --> 00:53:45.532
Kako me nazvao?
Dobro, dobro!

651
00:53:45.670 --> 00:53:47.707
Prekinite, obojica.

652
00:53:47.845 --> 00:53:49.329
E-sport ima pravo.

653
00:53:50.261 --> 00:53:51.607
Hajde sad.

654
00:53:53.609 --> 00:53:55.232
Ide li još netko?

655
00:53:56.923 --> 00:53:58.165
Ha?

656
00:53:59.408 --> 00:54:01.824
Opa!
Stani, Jesse. Što?

657
00:54:01.962 --> 00:54:03.274
Ako ova stvar potone,

658
00:54:03.412 --> 00:54:05.314
svatko tko je dolje
ostat će zarobljen unutra.

659
00:54:05.414 --> 00:54:06.381
Dobro?

660
00:54:06.519 --> 00:54:08.110
Jesse, ne budi glup, buraz.

661
00:54:08.210 --> 00:54:11.009
Neki od ovih ranjenih i starih
ljudi neće uspjeti van, čovječe.

662
00:54:11.109 --> 00:54:13.422
Jesse, vrati se ovamo. Jesse.

663
00:54:16.874 --> 00:54:19.117
Idemo. Hajde, hajde.

664
00:54:21.188 --> 00:54:23.639
Svi idu.
Da, svi idu.

665
00:54:23.777 --> 00:54:24.985
Samo naprijed.

666
00:54:25.123 --> 00:54:26.918
Samo diši.

667
00:54:27.056 --> 00:54:30.267
Izgleda da mi nećeš skoro
donijeti onu votku sa sodom.

668
00:55:14.241 --> 00:55:15.588
Treneru!

669
00:55:16.796 --> 00:55:18.073
Držim te!

670
00:55:18.211 --> 00:55:20.109
Jesi li ozlijeđena?
Lisa. Lisa.

671
00:55:20.247 --> 00:55:24.148
Lisa! Lisa.

672
00:55:24.286 --> 00:55:25.391
Ima li još koga?

673
00:55:25.529 --> 00:55:27.600
Treneru! Treneru!

674
00:55:31.466 --> 00:55:32.398
Treneru!

675
00:55:33.053 --> 00:55:34.261
Ne, ne, ne!

676
00:55:35.297 --> 00:55:37.092
Zgrabi ga, Jesse! Zgrabi ga!

677
00:55:49.138 --> 00:55:52.383
Miči se! Miči se!

678
00:55:52.521 --> 00:55:54.868
Treneru! Jesse!

679
00:55:58.182 --> 00:55:59.597
Hajde.

680
00:56:00.633 --> 00:56:01.668
Hej, hej. Polako.

681
00:56:02.531 --> 00:56:04.222
Ti.

682
00:56:04.361 --> 00:56:06.915
U vodu!
Polako. Polako.

683
00:56:07.053 --> 00:56:08.744
Ne, stani.
U vodu!

684
00:56:08.882 --> 00:56:09.918
Ne!
Uđi...

685
00:56:10.056 --> 00:56:11.229
Nisam znala!
U vodu!

686
00:56:11.368 --> 00:56:13.370
Prestani! Prestani!

687
00:56:16.442 --> 00:56:19.237
Prestani! Prestani, molim te!

688
00:56:20.860 --> 00:56:22.965
Prestani!
Hej! Hej!

689
00:56:24.173 --> 00:56:26.866
Kako ovo pomaže? Ha?

690
00:56:27.004 --> 00:56:28.661
Želiš li živjeti?

691
00:56:28.799 --> 00:56:30.007
Želiš li?

692
00:56:32.423 --> 00:56:34.183
Da. Da.

693
00:56:34.321 --> 00:56:36.841
Onda moramo ostati hladne glave.

694
00:56:36.979 --> 00:56:38.295
Reci mi da ćemo
ostati hladne glave.

695
00:56:38.395 --> 00:56:40.017
Ostat ću hladne glave.

696
00:56:49.820 --> 00:56:52.067
Mali, pojedi orašaste plodove.
Dobar protein.

697
00:56:52.167 --> 00:56:53.965
Dječaci koji rastu
trebaju proteine.

698
00:56:54.065 --> 00:56:55.760
Mama kaže da me orašasti plodovi debljaju.

699
00:56:55.860 --> 00:56:58.449
Kakva bi majka
rekla takvo što?

700
00:56:59.554 --> 00:57:02.180
Dobro, fino. Kvragu i orašasti plodovi.

701
00:57:02.280 --> 00:57:03.458
Koliko uopće imaš godina?

702
00:57:03.558 --> 00:57:04.907
Koliko zraka misliš
da nam je ostalo?

703
00:57:05.007 --> 00:57:06.008
Skoro osam.

704
00:57:06.146 --> 00:57:07.596
Imaš sedam.
Preopasno je.

705
00:57:07.734 --> 00:57:09.395
Pretpostavljam da si potpuno bez pelena.

706
00:57:09.495 --> 00:57:10.913
Što, da samo ne radimo ništa?

707
00:57:11.013 --> 00:57:12.774
Vrata ostaju zatvorena.

708
00:57:12.912 --> 00:57:15.224
Što misliš koliko ja imam godina?
Sto.

709
00:57:15.362 --> 00:57:16.571
Prilično blizu.

710
00:57:16.709 --> 00:57:18.404
Nitko nas neće pronaći
ako ostanemo ovdje.

711
00:57:18.504 --> 00:57:20.816
O, bravo, ljudi.

712
00:57:20.954 --> 00:57:22.853
Ha?
Već postaje zagušljivo.

713
00:57:22.991 --> 00:57:25.203
Mogli bismo plivati.

714
00:57:25.303 --> 00:57:26.512
Ja mogu prvi,

715
00:57:26.650 --> 00:57:28.893
zaroniti i pronaći izlaz.
Ne.

716
00:57:29.031 --> 00:57:30.761
Ne, ne dok sam ja tu.
Mogu ja to.

717
00:57:30.861 --> 00:57:32.107
Znam avion
bolje od tebe.

718
00:57:32.207 --> 00:57:33.898
A ti imaš slomljen zglob.

719
00:57:34.036 --> 00:57:35.935
Koji si popravila,
sjećaš se?

720
00:57:36.798 --> 00:57:38.420
Evo, učvrsti ga.

721
00:57:40.871 --> 00:57:42.044
Hajde.

722
00:57:42.182 --> 00:57:43.874
Nemamo puno vremena.
Hajde.

723
00:57:45.910 --> 00:57:48.741
Dobro. Dakle, malo ću
pogledati okolo

724
00:57:48.879 --> 00:57:51.571
i vratiti se
začas, dobro?

725
00:57:51.709 --> 00:57:52.745
Da? Da.

726
00:57:52.883 --> 00:57:54.471
Dobro. Super.

727
00:57:56.542 --> 00:57:57.474
Nemoj ići.

728
00:58:00.200 --> 00:58:01.719
Hej, Finn.

729
00:58:01.857 --> 00:58:04.308
Čuvaj mi dame
dok me nema, može?

730
00:58:05.965 --> 00:58:07.898
Dobro, dobro, dobro.

731
00:58:13.455 --> 00:58:14.767
Požuri natrag...

732
00:58:14.905 --> 00:58:16.251
Matt.

733
00:58:17.666 --> 00:58:19.875
Zapamtila je moje ime. Ha?

734
00:58:20.013 --> 00:58:22.798
Gle, imam dobar osjećaj u vezi nas.

735
00:59:25.631 --> 00:59:26.666
Hej, hej!

736
00:59:26.804 --> 00:59:28.495
Hej, ovdje!

737
00:59:29.427 --> 00:59:30.463
Pomozite nam!

738
00:59:31.291 --> 00:59:33.570
Upomoć! Ovdje!

739
00:59:33.708 --> 00:59:36.906
Ima ljudi kojima treba pomoć! Upomoć!

740
00:59:38.195 --> 00:59:39.368
Moja kći, Cora.

741
00:59:46.341 --> 00:59:48.239
Upomoć!

742
00:59:52.727 --> 00:59:54.798
Upomoć!
Kako se ovo moglo dogoditi?

743
00:59:58.353 --> 00:59:59.457
Usred smo
ničega.

744
00:59:59.596 --> 01:00:00.600
Kako samo tako
padneš s neba?

745
01:00:00.700 --> 01:00:02.084
Koliko dugo do spašavanja?

746
01:00:02.184 --> 01:00:04.393
Ne pametuj.
Samo odgovori na pitanje.

747
01:00:04.531 --> 01:00:06.779
Gledajte, reći ću vam
ono što znam, dobro?

748
01:00:06.879 --> 01:00:09.264
Vjerojatno je tvoja jebena krivnja.

749
01:00:09.364 --> 01:00:11.128
Tvoja i ove usrane aviokompanije.

750
01:00:11.228 --> 01:00:13.130
Gledajte, ljuti ste,
želite odgovore.

751
01:00:13.230 --> 01:00:14.680
Dobit ćete ih, dobro?

752
01:00:17.268 --> 01:00:20.743
Istina je da smo sretni
što smo živi i možemo nekoga kriviti.

753
01:00:21.410 --> 01:00:23.412
Na ovom je letu bilo
257 duša.

754
01:00:25.483 --> 01:00:27.244
Brojim možda 30 nas.

755
01:00:30.419 --> 01:00:31.766
Kako ja to vidim,

756
01:00:32.559 --> 01:00:33.940
imamo jedan zadatak,

757
01:00:35.355 --> 01:00:37.464
a to je vratiti se kući
i vidjeti svoje obitelji.

758
01:00:37.564 --> 01:00:40.153
Dobro, imamo splavi.
Moramo u njih.

759
01:00:40.291 --> 01:00:42.400
Ako nemate prsluk za spašavanje,
uzmite jedan ispod sjedala.

760
01:00:42.500 --> 01:00:44.230
Reci mi svoje ime.
Ja sam Hutch.

761
01:00:44.330 --> 01:00:47.057
Hutch, trebaš izvući
tu drugu splav.

762
01:00:47.195 --> 01:00:50.439
Svi, pomozite Hutchu
da splav spusti u vodu.

763
01:00:55.410 --> 01:00:57.584
Zapela je! Zapela je!

764
01:00:59.828 --> 01:01:01.140
Evo, drži se za to.

765
01:01:01.278 --> 01:01:03.421
Cora, trebam da
ostaneš ovdje, dobro?

766
01:01:03.521 --> 01:01:04.491
Drži se dalje od ruba, u redu?

767
01:01:04.591 --> 01:01:05.662
Dobro.

768
01:01:05.800 --> 01:01:07.077
Idem po nešto.

769
01:01:07.215 --> 01:01:10.241
Hej, svi budite oprezni.
Plima se brzo kreće.

770
01:01:13.014 --> 01:01:14.153
Dva, tamo...

771
01:01:19.814 --> 01:01:21.816
Dobro, idemo. Spremni?

772
01:01:29.237 --> 01:01:31.607
Mislim da smo uspjeli.

773
01:01:46.254 --> 01:01:47.807
Dobro, spremni? Spremni?

774
01:01:50.361 --> 01:01:51.362
Tata.

775
01:01:53.364 --> 01:01:55.366
Tata!

776
01:02:05.100 --> 01:02:07.037
Hej, vrati se! Ovo nam treba!
Idemo, idemo.

777
01:02:07.137 --> 01:02:10.174
Idi. Idi, idi, idi. Idemo.
Bježimo odavde.

778
01:02:10.312 --> 01:02:12.487
Bilo tko, molim vas, pomozite mi!

779
01:02:13.868 --> 01:02:15.110
Hajde, dušo.

780
01:02:18.320 --> 01:02:19.463
Možemo mi to. Spremna?

781
01:02:19.563 --> 01:02:20.875
Idi, idi, idi.

782
01:02:22.186 --> 01:02:24.948
Možemo mi to. Jedan, dva, tri!

783
01:02:25.086 --> 01:02:26.397
Vuci!
Tata!

784
01:02:26.535 --> 01:02:28.399
Cora!
Vuci!

785
01:02:28.537 --> 01:02:29.749
Stavi ovo na splav,
nemoj ispustiti.

786
01:02:29.849 --> 01:02:31.437
Tata!
Cora!

787
01:02:31.575 --> 01:02:33.646
Bježimo odavde.
Tata, žao mi je!

788
01:02:34.785 --> 01:02:36.856
Cora! Cora! Hajde.
Žao mi je!

789
01:02:38.824 --> 01:02:41.105
Makni se odande!
Ne, čovječe, što to radiš?

790
01:02:41.205 --> 01:02:42.348
Zašto se nije otvorila?

791
01:02:42.448 --> 01:02:44.105
Ne znam,
povuci jebeno uže!

792
01:03:32.222 --> 01:03:33.154
Hajde, hajde.

793
01:03:36.122 --> 01:03:38.320
Hajde.

794
01:04:04.737 --> 01:04:05.703
Hej!

795
01:04:06.670 --> 01:04:07.878
Ovdje!

796
01:04:09.880 --> 01:04:11.537
ELT.

797
01:04:11.675 --> 01:04:12.745
Što?

798
01:04:12.883 --> 01:04:16.496
Lokator. Ona kutija
koju sam ti dao. Gdje je?

799
01:04:21.236 --> 01:04:22.410
Zezaš me.

800
01:04:23.583 --> 01:04:24.968
Hajde, čovječe,
računao sam na tebe.

801
01:04:25.068 --> 01:04:26.555
Sve što si trebao učiniti bilo je
staviti ga na splav.

802
01:04:26.655 --> 01:04:29.455
Da, pa, ako je bilo toliko važno,
možda si ga ti trebao čuvati.

803
01:04:29.555 --> 01:04:31.246
Lokator?
O čemu on govori?

804
01:04:31.384 --> 01:04:33.770
Je li to ono što im treba
da nas pronađu?

805
01:04:33.870 --> 01:04:34.840
I ti si ga izgubio?

806
01:04:34.940 --> 01:04:37.494
Hej, ne prebacuj to
na mene, čovječe.

807
01:04:37.632 --> 01:04:39.914
To je bila tvoja
odgovornost, kapetane. Hej!

808
01:04:40.014 --> 01:04:41.463
Tamo!
Hej!

809
01:04:42.602 --> 01:04:44.294
Ovdje!
Vidite li ih?

810
01:04:45.467 --> 01:04:47.266
Molim te, učini nešto.
Nema šanse.

811
01:04:47.366 --> 01:04:49.337
Ne, mogu otplivati
do druge splavi.

812
01:04:49.437 --> 01:04:51.201
Struja je prejaka.
Nikad neće uspjeti.

813
01:04:51.301 --> 01:04:53.579
Zar ne vidiš
da već primamo vodu?

814
01:05:05.625 --> 01:05:08.456
Hej... Što... Što...

815
01:05:09.284 --> 01:05:10.458
O, Bože!

816
01:05:13.840 --> 01:05:15.121
Tko si ti, dovraga,
da odlučuješ?

817
01:05:15.221 --> 01:05:18.328
Ja sam kapetan.
To je moj avion.

818
01:05:18.466 --> 01:05:19.812
O, taj avion?

819
01:05:20.468 --> 01:05:21.848
Sjajan posao. Ha?

820
01:05:21.987 --> 01:05:24.334
Ljudi su mrtvi
zbog tebe.

821
01:05:24.472 --> 01:05:27.993
A sad želiš riskirati naše
živote da bi se osjećao bolje?

822
01:05:28.131 --> 01:05:30.133
Nema šanse. Ostajemo tu.

823
01:05:42.869 --> 01:05:44.699
Ti sebe nazivaš
kapetanom, ha?

824
01:05:46.114 --> 01:05:48.013
Ne znaš ni upravljati splavom.

825
01:05:50.808 --> 01:05:52.810
Idemo po njih.

826
01:05:52.949 --> 01:05:54.195
Prokleto dobro znaš
što će se dogoditi

827
01:05:54.295 --> 01:05:56.711
toj dvojici mladića
ako ne odemo.

828
01:05:56.849 --> 01:05:58.333
Odvežite ove splavi.

829
01:06:03.166 --> 01:06:04.305
Ne!
Hej!

830
01:06:05.962 --> 01:06:07.480
Udario me.

831
01:06:07.618 --> 01:06:08.519
Ti si svjedok.

832
01:06:08.619 --> 01:06:11.139
Začepi, kujo.

833
01:06:12.658 --> 01:06:13.935
Čuo si damu.

834
01:06:14.073 --> 01:06:16.282
I prestani ljuljati splav.
Idemo.

835
01:06:25.153 --> 01:06:26.292
Želim ići.

836
01:06:26.430 --> 01:06:29.157
Koliko još
moramo ostati ovdje?

837
01:06:29.295 --> 01:06:32.770
Nadam se da Matt nije otplivao
s nekom sirenom.

838
01:06:33.299 --> 01:06:34.438
Ne bi nas ostavio.

839
01:06:56.115 --> 01:06:57.220
Što čeka?

840
01:06:59.256 --> 01:07:00.430
Što čeka?

841
01:07:17.102 --> 01:07:18.206
Idemo odavde.

842
01:07:20.174 --> 01:07:22.279
Daj mi ruku.
Hajde.

843
01:07:25.524 --> 01:07:26.490
Hajde!

844
01:07:28.354 --> 01:07:30.425
Hajde, hajde, hajde.

845
01:07:39.848 --> 01:07:42.218
Vas dvoje opet, ha?

846
01:07:45.544 --> 01:07:46.583
Dobro,
idemo odavde.

847
01:07:46.683 --> 01:07:47.787
Idemo.

848
01:07:53.483 --> 01:07:57.556
Kad izađemo iz aviona,
napuhat ćemo prsluke.

849
01:07:57.694 --> 01:07:59.661
Odvest će nas
ravno na površinu

850
01:07:59.799 --> 01:08:00.804
kao veliki balon.

851
01:08:00.904 --> 01:08:02.906
Ne, treba mi još malo vremena.

852
01:08:03.044 --> 01:08:04.770
Ne možeš ostati ovdje.

853
01:08:04.908 --> 01:08:07.669
Ne mogu povesti oboje.
Možeš ti to.

854
01:08:07.807 --> 01:08:09.326
Radim ovo, radim ono.

855
01:08:09.464 --> 01:08:12.191
Uvijek pokušavam
stalno nešto raditi.

856
01:08:12.329 --> 01:08:14.124
Otkad je Bill umro,

857
01:08:15.021 --> 01:08:16.544
to jednostavno postane zamorno, znaš?

858
01:08:16.644 --> 01:08:19.374
Becky, žao mi je. Stvarno.
Ali moramo odmah ići.

859
01:08:19.474 --> 01:08:21.821
Ne, znam. Uzmi Finna.

860
01:08:21.959 --> 01:08:23.651
Ne! I ti dođi. Molim te.

861
01:08:23.789 --> 01:08:26.032
Ostani jak, frajeru.

862
01:08:26.171 --> 01:08:29.208
Divim se tvom stilu.
Ne brini za mene.

863
01:08:33.350 --> 01:08:36.250
Vratit ću se, Becky.
Obećavam.

864
01:08:37.803 --> 01:08:39.425
Jesi dobro? Da?

865
01:08:40.046 --> 01:08:41.324
Dobar dečko.

866
01:09:47.976 --> 01:09:49.530
Matt!

867
01:09:56.675 --> 01:09:57.917
Možemo uspjeti.

868
01:09:59.540 --> 01:10:01.852
Dakle, kapetane,
imaš li plan

869
01:10:01.990 --> 01:10:04.890
koji se ne oslanja
samo na glupu sreću?

870
01:10:05.960 --> 01:10:06.995
Znaš, živi smo.

871
01:10:08.204 --> 01:10:09.619
Svi smo živi.

872
01:10:12.932 --> 01:10:13.968
Imaš djecu?

873
01:10:18.006 --> 01:10:19.318
Da.

874
01:10:20.354 --> 01:10:22.701
Kćer Terri.

875
01:10:22.839 --> 01:10:25.945
Malog sina Seana.

876
01:10:26.083 --> 01:10:28.331
Pa, ja ih imam troje.

877
01:10:28.431 --> 01:10:29.880
Najmlađe ima pet.

878
01:10:31.399 --> 01:10:33.677
Mogu ti reći da neće
odrasti bez mene.

879
01:10:35.196 --> 01:10:37.198
Zato, što god morao učiniti

880
01:10:37.336 --> 01:10:41.482
da se sam osjećaš bolje zbog svih
onih ljudi koje si izgubio tamo...

881
01:10:41.582 --> 01:10:44.642
mene nemoj koristiti, prijatelju.

882
01:10:45.241 --> 01:10:46.690
Jer ja idem kući...

883
01:10:47.864 --> 01:10:50.234
kako god bude trebalo.

884
01:10:51.281 --> 01:10:53.908
Da, siguran sam da su tvoja djeca
stvarno ponosna na tebe.

885
01:10:54.008 --> 01:10:56.976
Nije ni čudo da si solo.

886
01:11:03.120 --> 01:11:04.398
Avion!

887
01:11:05.675 --> 01:11:07.228
Avion je ovdje.
Hej!

888
01:11:07.366 --> 01:11:08.471
Hej!
Hej!

889
01:11:08.609 --> 01:11:09.713
Hej!
Hej!

890
01:11:09.851 --> 01:11:11.577
Hej!
Hej!

891
01:11:11.715 --> 01:11:14.235
Hej! Hej!

892
01:11:15.132 --> 01:11:16.272
Hej!

893
01:11:34.497 --> 01:11:36.153
Hej!
Hej!

894
01:11:36.292 --> 01:11:37.672
Dolje smo, kretenu!

895
01:11:38.984 --> 01:11:40.296
Dolje smo, kretenu!

896
01:11:42.677 --> 01:11:44.679
Dolje smo, kretenu!

897
01:11:45.404 --> 01:11:46.305
Hej! Hej!

898
01:11:46.405 --> 01:11:47.475
Hej!

899
01:11:52.238 --> 01:11:53.381
Jesu li nas vidjeli?

900
01:11:53.481 --> 01:11:55.345
Vidjeli su nas, sigurno.

901
01:11:56.484 --> 01:11:58.279
Samo se moramo držati.

902
01:12:25.271 --> 01:12:27.895
Zoe!

903
01:13:16.115 --> 01:13:17.876
Zoe!

904
01:13:18.014 --> 01:13:18.946
Zoe!

905
01:13:19.843 --> 01:13:21.983
Zoe, probudi se!

906
01:13:23.260 --> 01:13:24.469
Neka netko pomogne!

907
01:13:26.436 --> 01:13:28.473
Neka netko pomogne!

908
01:15:09.194 --> 01:15:11.092
Moja draga mala Bella.

909
01:15:14.510 --> 01:15:16.304
Ne znam
zašto ovo radim.

910
01:15:19.376 --> 01:15:20.964
Nikad me nećeš čuti.

911
01:15:21.827 --> 01:15:23.139
Nema signala.

912
01:15:25.348 --> 01:15:26.349
Bella...

913
01:15:30.042 --> 01:15:32.010
malo ću popričati s Bogom...

914
01:15:33.356 --> 01:15:37.463
i zamoliti ga da ti ispuni život
s toliko...

915
01:15:41.882 --> 01:15:42.883
radosti...

916
01:15:48.060 --> 01:15:50.741
koliko si je ti dala meni.

917
01:16:17.469 --> 01:16:19.195
Guam, Red Tail 24.

918
01:16:19.333 --> 01:16:21.369
Ima li novosti
oko prijevoza?

919
01:16:21.507 --> 01:16:22.750
Radimo na tome.

920
01:16:22.888 --> 01:16:24.134
Imamo kinesku koću
u području.

921
01:16:24.234 --> 01:16:25.477
Red Tail 24, čekajte.

922
01:16:26.271 --> 01:16:27.306
Razumijem.

923
01:17:07.174 --> 01:17:09.797
Ovdje Xing Yang Yuan Yu 08.

924
01:17:09.935 --> 01:17:13.180
Kapetane, aktiviramo
SOLAS konvenciju iz 1974.

925
01:17:13.318 --> 01:17:15.496
Došlo je do pada
komercijalnog zrakoplova.

926
01:17:15.596 --> 01:17:18.741
Vaš je brod najbliži području
gdje vjerujemo da ima preživjelih

927
01:17:18.841 --> 01:17:20.325
kojima treba pomoć.

928
01:17:20.463 --> 01:17:22.937
Razumijem, zapovjedniče.

929
01:18:12.722 --> 01:18:14.068
Što?

930
01:18:14.206 --> 01:18:15.138
Hvala.

931
01:18:20.178 --> 01:18:21.213
Samo joj reci.

932
01:18:24.320 --> 01:18:26.322
Da si lud za njom.

933
01:18:32.397 --> 01:18:34.851
Ne mogu kršiti pravila momčadi.

934
01:18:34.951 --> 01:18:37.459
Koje pravilo momčadi?

935
01:18:40.474 --> 01:18:43.511
Igrači ne smiju izlaziti
jedni s drugima.

936
01:18:43.649 --> 01:18:45.410
Bože moj.

937
01:18:45.548 --> 01:18:47.481
Baš si idiot.

938
01:18:48.862 --> 01:18:50.760
Nitko ne sluša to pravilo.

939
01:18:52.486 --> 01:18:53.970
Samo joj reci.

940
01:18:56.455 --> 01:18:57.733
Hej, Cora.

941
01:18:58.906 --> 01:18:59.907
Popij ovo.

942
01:19:01.840 --> 01:19:03.566
Nisu ovdje.

943
01:19:06.155 --> 01:19:07.363
Hej.
Ostavili su me.

944
01:19:10.055 --> 01:19:11.022
Ma daj.

945
01:19:15.474 --> 01:19:16.579
Nisu te ostavili.

946
01:19:21.032 --> 01:19:23.689
Tata mi je rekao da pazim
na svog malog brata.

947
01:19:28.833 --> 01:19:30.110
Bila sam grozna.

948
01:19:34.286 --> 01:19:35.287
Ne mrzim ga.

949
01:19:36.012 --> 01:19:36.944
Znam.

950
01:19:41.052 --> 01:19:42.122
Ima sedam godina.

951
01:19:50.682 --> 01:19:53.087
Moj sin ima sedam godina.

952
01:20:02.728 --> 01:20:04.558
To je Sean,
tu desno.

953
01:20:09.390 --> 01:20:10.426
On nema sedam.

954
01:20:15.224 --> 01:20:16.432
To je stara slika.

955
01:20:26.028 --> 01:20:27.719
Ha?

956
01:20:27.857 --> 01:20:31.125
Nikad neće vidjeti
kakva ću postati.

957
01:20:35.175 --> 01:20:37.487
Hej, znat će.

958
01:20:38.661 --> 01:20:41.100
Roditelji uvijek znaju.

959
01:20:42.182 --> 01:20:43.631
Uvijek su s tobom, Cora.

960
01:20:50.190 --> 01:20:52.951
O, da. O, Bože.

961
01:20:54.401 --> 01:20:55.712
O, Bože!
O, hej.

962
01:20:55.851 --> 01:20:57.818
O, Bože.
Spasit će nas.

963
01:20:57.956 --> 01:21:00.510
Hutch, pazi na Coru.

964
01:21:00.648 --> 01:21:02.616
Ovdje!
Hej, ovdje smo!

965
01:21:02.754 --> 01:21:05.688
Guam, Red Tail 24,
imamo preživjele.

966
01:21:05.826 --> 01:21:09.301
Bacamo signalne baklje
i šaljemo plivača u vodu.

967
01:21:13.869 --> 01:21:15.698
Hej!

968
01:21:15.836 --> 01:21:18.011
Spusti plivača.

969
01:21:21.324 --> 01:21:22.601
Hej!

970
01:21:24.880 --> 01:21:26.398
Ne!

971
01:21:26.536 --> 01:21:28.918
Kod vrata smo.
Razumijem. Spremni ste.

972
01:21:31.265 --> 01:21:33.129
Ne!

973
01:21:34.027 --> 01:21:35.476
Vidimo vas.

974
01:21:41.827 --> 01:21:43.899
Ne!
Ne!

975
01:21:51.872 --> 01:21:53.460
Ne!

976
01:21:56.704 --> 01:21:58.227
Ne mogu nas podići.
Gore, gore, gore!

977
01:21:58.327 --> 01:22:01.007
Red Tail 24,
je li sve u redu?

978
01:22:05.161 --> 01:22:06.680
O, Bože!

979
01:22:16.069 --> 01:22:19.348
Odreži ga. Odreži ga!

980
01:22:47.686 --> 01:22:49.895
Izvucite me!
Izvucite me iz vode!

981
01:22:50.034 --> 01:22:50.966
Daj mi ruku.

982
01:22:53.796 --> 01:22:55.142
Izvucite me!

983
01:22:59.664 --> 01:23:01.965
Izvucite me odavde!

984
01:23:04.220 --> 01:23:05.325
Ne!

985
01:23:07.672 --> 01:23:09.869
Gad!

986
01:23:13.954 --> 01:23:15.507
Hej!
Hej!

987
01:23:15.645 --> 01:23:17.475
Ovdje sam!

988
01:23:17.613 --> 01:23:19.304
Hej!
Hej!

989
01:23:35.389 --> 01:23:36.494
Zašto su stali?

990
01:23:37.391 --> 01:23:38.292
Zašto su stali?

991
01:23:40.636 --> 01:23:42.948
Ne mogu proći preko grebena.

992
01:23:43.087 --> 01:23:44.812
Moramo mi do njih.

993
01:23:44.950 --> 01:23:46.745
Kako?
Gdje su vesla?

994
01:23:46.883 --> 01:23:49.196
Nemamo vesla.
Nemamo vesla.

995
01:23:49.334 --> 01:23:51.026
I što sad, kapetane?

996
01:23:53.131 --> 01:23:55.513
Struja će nas odnijeti
u duboku vodu.

997
01:23:55.651 --> 01:23:56.755
Hej!

998
01:23:56.893 --> 01:23:58.588
Druge splavi,
one imaju vesla.

999
01:23:58.688 --> 01:23:59.827
One će uspjeti.

1000
01:24:01.622 --> 01:24:02.554
Gdje je Cora?

1001
01:24:03.279 --> 01:24:04.453
Ona djevojčica.

1002
01:24:04.591 --> 01:24:06.938
Cora? Cora? Cora?

1003
01:24:09.147 --> 01:24:10.459
Je li u vodi?

1004
01:24:10.597 --> 01:24:12.357
Cora?
Cora?

1005
01:24:13.324 --> 01:24:14.532
Eno je! Tamo!

1006
01:24:14.670 --> 01:24:16.016
Gledajte, gledajte!

1007
01:24:16.154 --> 01:24:17.983
Hej!
Cora!

1008
01:24:18.122 --> 01:24:19.537
Cora, ostani tamo!

1009
01:24:33.723 --> 01:24:35.000
Cora.
Cora!

1010
01:24:35.139 --> 01:24:36.212
Moramo otići po nju.

1011
01:24:36.312 --> 01:24:37.417
Struja je prejaka.

1012
01:24:37.555 --> 01:24:39.215
Pa, druga splav
skoro je stigla.

1013
01:24:39.315 --> 01:24:42.341
Taj će avion biti
pod vodom za 15 minuta.

1014
01:24:42.525 --> 01:24:43.664
Dobro, idem po nju.

1015
01:24:43.802 --> 01:24:45.597
Morski psi.
Jesi li lud?

1016
01:24:45.735 --> 01:24:48.980
Posvuda su.
Ne, tvoj je čamac.

1017
01:24:49.118 --> 01:24:50.119
Hej, ne, čekaj!

1018
01:24:56.781 --> 01:24:57.782
Ne.

1019
01:24:59.611 --> 01:25:02.097
Plivaj brzo! Brže plivaj!

1020
01:25:02.235 --> 01:25:04.029
Može uspjeti.
Uspjet će.

1021
01:25:05.030 --> 01:25:06.273
Pomozite mi!

1022
01:25:07.067 --> 01:25:10.312
Ja sam Amerikanac!

1023
01:25:37.339 --> 01:25:38.650
Uspio je!
Da!

1024
01:25:38.788 --> 01:25:39.789
Da!

1025
01:25:44.967 --> 01:25:46.520
Cora, hej.

1026
01:25:46.658 --> 01:25:48.905
Cora, pogledaj me.

1027
01:25:49.005 --> 01:25:49.972
Hej.

1028
01:25:51.353 --> 01:25:54.321
Cora, idemo malo
plivati.

1029
01:25:54.459 --> 01:25:56.081
Zajedno. Ti i ja.

1030
01:25:56.220 --> 01:25:58.946
Želim ostati ovdje
sa svojim tatom.

1031
01:25:59.084 --> 01:26:00.914
Ne možeš ostati ovdje, Cora.

1032
01:26:01.052 --> 01:26:03.851
Moramo krenuti
malim zaobilaznim putem, dobro?

1033
01:26:03.951 --> 01:26:06.368
Voda se diže, Cora.

1034
01:26:06.506 --> 01:26:09.405
Tvoj tata želi da budeš
hrabra cura, dobro?

1035
01:26:11.683 --> 01:26:13.168
U redu,
stavimo ti ovo.

1036
01:26:14.721 --> 01:26:17.482
Dobro? Evo ga.

1037
01:26:18.828 --> 01:26:20.554
Bit ćemo
dobro, Cora.

1038
01:26:21.383 --> 01:26:22.832
Možemo mi to, dobro?

1039
01:26:24.351 --> 01:26:26.353
Stavit ću ovaj remen
preko vrata,

1040
01:26:26.491 --> 01:26:27.872
oko leđa, dobro?

1041
01:26:28.010 --> 01:26:31.116
I želim da se držiš za njega
dok plivamo. U redu?

1042
01:26:31.255 --> 01:26:33.049
Nećeš ga
pustiti, dobro?

1043
01:26:33.188 --> 01:26:34.534
Drži se čvrsto.
Dobro.

1044
01:26:34.672 --> 01:26:36.121
Hej, udaljavamo se.

1045
01:26:36.260 --> 01:26:38.400
Udaljavamo se,
udaljavamo se od njih.

1046
01:26:38.538 --> 01:26:40.954
Krivi smjer, budalo.
Prema brodu!

1047
01:26:46.097 --> 01:26:48.548
Zgrabi remen, Cora. Zgrabi ga.

1048
01:28:00.344 --> 01:28:02.000
Morski pas! Morski pas!

1049
01:28:17.326 --> 01:28:18.534
Svi su otišli.

1050
01:28:19.190 --> 01:28:20.329
Zašto su otišli?

1051
01:28:21.503 --> 01:28:23.401
Samo Bog zna.

1052
01:28:32.755 --> 01:28:36.587
U redu je, u redu je.
Sve je u redu.

1053
01:28:36.725 --> 01:28:38.036
Bit će u redu.

1054
01:28:38.174 --> 01:28:39.144
Mislim da su otišli.

1055
01:28:39.244 --> 01:28:41.419
Bit ćemo dobro.

1056
01:29:01.715 --> 01:29:03.913
Da.

1057
01:29:12.692 --> 01:29:14.314
Kučkin sine.

1058
01:29:18.145 --> 01:29:21.148
O, Bože!

1059
01:32:02.862 --> 01:32:05.140
Evo, Cora.
Stavimo ti ovo oko tebe.

1060
01:32:14.667 --> 01:32:17.532
Mali zaobilazak. Ha?

1061
01:32:18.360 --> 01:32:19.292
Da.

1062
01:32:20.362 --> 01:32:21.501
Mali zaobilazak.

1063
01:32:26.644 --> 01:32:28.232
Hej!
Hej, imamo signal.

1064
01:32:28.370 --> 01:32:30.717
Imamo vezu.
Bene, imamo vezu!

1065
01:32:30.855 --> 01:32:31.925
Telefoni rade!

1066
01:32:34.272 --> 01:32:36.136
Čip za ljubimce. Tvoj telefon?

1067
01:32:36.274 --> 01:32:37.655
Vidiš li svoj telefon?

1068
01:32:39.036 --> 01:32:40.313
Mogu li ga vidjeti?

1069
01:32:44.075 --> 01:32:46.491
Lozinka mu je rođendan.

1070
01:32:50.357 --> 01:32:52.325
Evo. Vidiš?

1071
01:32:59.988 --> 01:33:01.230
Hvala, kapetane.

1072
01:33:01.368 --> 01:33:03.857
Vašoj posadi dugujemo
sve što ste učinili za nas.

1073
01:33:03.957 --> 01:33:04.993
Hvala.

1074
01:33:07.202 --> 01:33:09.204
Splav. Ondje.

1075
01:33:15.003 --> 01:33:16.556
Gdje mi je brat?

1076
01:33:16.694 --> 01:33:18.213
Mora biti ovdje.

1077
01:33:18.351 --> 01:33:20.111
Pratitelj kaže da je ovdje.

1078
01:33:20.940 --> 01:33:21.737
Finn?

1079
01:33:21.837 --> 01:33:23.770
Žao mi je, Cora.

1080
01:33:24.737 --> 01:33:26.934
Finn.

1081
01:33:33.055 --> 01:33:34.436
Finn! Finn!

1082
01:33:34.574 --> 01:33:35.713
Zoe!
Finn!

1083
01:33:35.851 --> 01:33:37.439
Finn, Finn!

1084
01:33:37.577 --> 01:33:39.061
Uspjeli smo.

1085
01:33:39.199 --> 01:33:40.753
Cora!
Finn! Finn!

1086
01:33:40.891 --> 01:33:42.755
Hajde. Evo ga.

1087
01:33:49.727 --> 01:33:51.073
Žao mi je.

1088
01:33:52.454 --> 01:33:53.593
U redu je, Cora.

1089
01:34:04.708 --> 01:34:06.502
Becky? Becky?

1090
01:34:06.641 --> 01:34:07.780
Čeka me.

1091
01:34:13.337 --> 01:34:14.579
Hajde,
podignimo je.

1092
01:35:18.643 --> 01:35:20.576
Bene?
Ja sam.

1093
01:35:20.715 --> 01:35:23.718
O, Bože. Jesi li dobro?

1094
01:35:23.856 --> 01:35:26.272
Da.
Mislila sam da smo te izgubili.

1095
01:35:26.410 --> 01:35:28.377
Dobro sam.

1096
01:35:28.515 --> 01:35:30.245
Bene...
Daj mi da razgovaram s njim!

1097
01:35:30.345 --> 01:35:31.311
Sean... O, Bože.

1098
01:35:31.449 --> 01:35:33.248
Tata je na telefonu
upravo sada.

1099
01:35:33.348 --> 01:35:34.318
Tata, jesi li tu?

1100
01:35:34.418 --> 01:35:35.902
Tu sam, Sean.
Tu sam.

1101
01:35:37.835 --> 01:35:38.905
Gdje si?

1102
01:35:39.837 --> 01:35:41.632
Vraćam se kući.

1103
01:35:41.770 --> 01:35:45.222
Mama, vraća se kući.
Vraća se kući!

1104
01:35:45.360 --> 01:35:47.883
Rekla sam ti
da hoće, dušo.

1105
01:35:47.983 --> 01:35:49.191
Volim te, tata.

1106
01:35:49.329 --> 01:35:52.263
I ja tebe volim, sine.
Volim vas sve.

1107
01:35:57.263 --> 01:36:07.263
Prijevod by ZiBrZg
